        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our lives are shaped by our choices - choices based upon the world around us. Life does not exist in a vacuum; there are always influences, and there are always options. At times, they are few; at others, they are overwhelming. We cannot always see what the outcome might be. But there is always a choice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each moment of our lives is a chance, an instant of possibility... a nexus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at a crossroads of destiny - which path will you follow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nexus: The Zoraidian Oracle is a solitaire card game with three distinct purposes - to entertain you, to relax you, and to challenge your strategic and critical thinking skills - based upon whatever your frame of mind desires it to be. Inspired by Hanafuda, a traditional Japanese flower card game, Nexus is a versatile diversion for the mind and the spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique deck of 144 cards, encompassing both a Lesser and a Greater Arcana, Nexus has been described as an intriguing cross between gin rummy and the Tarot. </p>",
